Dialogue: 2,0:22:23.37,0:22:27.00,ED,,0,0,0,,{=18=69}{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Coragem está em dois mundos, juntos agora
Dialogue: 2,0:22:27.00,0:22:27.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Essa é a prova!)
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.41,0:22:30.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}É isso que nos conecta
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.37,0:22:33.71,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Todos sorriem para garotas bonitas
Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.71,0:22:34.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Meu Sonho!)
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.59,0:22:37.51,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Só quero saber o que o futuro guarda
Dialogue: 2,0:22:37.51,0:22:38.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Sozinha!)
Dialogue: 2,0:22:38.13,0:22:42.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Mesmo que as estrelas em um céu sem lua
Dialogue: 2,0:22:42.59,0:22:44.85,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}ainda brilhem
Dialogue: 2,0:22:44.18,0:22:45.01,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Sem magia!)
Dialogue: 2,0:22:44.85,0:22:49.64,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Mesmo que as nuvens em um céu sem sol
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.64,0:22:52.06,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}ainda sigam seu caminho
Dialogue: 2,0:22:51.44,0:22:54.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Eu continuo tristemente
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.36,0:22:56.65,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Que parecia que sempre ficaria ao meu lado)
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.65,0:22:58.49,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}a procurar por você
Dialogue: 2,0:22:58.49,0:23:02.41,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Vou enquadrar uma foto de nós dois e pendurar
Dialogue: 2,0:23:02.41,0:23:06.74,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Vou organizar tudo do meu jeito, como eu quiser, como realmente é
Dialogue: 2,0:23:06.74,0:23:10.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Nossa sintonia: somar, subtrair, multiplicar, dividir por...
Dialogue: 2,0:23:10.16,0:23:10.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Eu amo tudo isso!
Dialogue: 2,0:23:10.91,0:23:14.25,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Me chamando, te chamando
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.25,0:23:15.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(E Você)
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.38,0:23:17.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Quero subir as escadas do futuro com você
Dialogue: 2,0:23:17.92,0:23:20.76,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\i1}Lucky lucky shiny{\i0}, nossos corações vibrando em sonhos
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.76,0:23:24.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Se amanhã o céu estiver limpo, vai ficar tudo bem
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.93,0:23:28.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Talvez eu esteja um pouco triste e fraco
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.39,0:23:29.43,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Mas Feliz!)
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.39,0:23:32.23,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Mas quando estou com você, me sinto salva
Dialogue: 2,0:23:32.23,0:23:34.06,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Não existe tempo perdido
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.06,0:23:36.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Vamos esperar a chuva passar
Dialogue: 2,0:23:36.40,0:23:39.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Olha para o céu! Se fizer isso
Dialogue: 2,0:23:39.36,0:23:42.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Coragem está em dois mundos, juntos agora
Dialogue: 2,0:23:42.86,0:23:43.82,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Essa é a prova!)
Dialogue: 2,0:23:44.32,0:23:46.41,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}É isso que nos conecta
Dialogue: 2,0:23:46.41,0:23:49.70,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Todos sorriem para garotas bonitas
Dialogue: 2,0:23:49.70,0:23:52.25,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Que tipo de futuro essa holofote irá iluminar?
